After installing Vivado and Veriletor

run the following command

\rm -rf obj_dir zap.vcd; verilator --trace --binary --timing --exe --build -Wno-CMPCONST -Wno-WIDTHEXPAND -j $(nproc) -f file_list --top-module zap_test

This will run uart test at 192 baud, 1 stop bit, no parity and no flow control.
